The Heart: Orchestrator 8
The 40 kHz heartbeat isn’t just a clock. It’s the systolic pulse. Every tick, the heart contracts and pushes a fresh cycle of data into the arteries.
Arteries: Sector-Feed Buffers
Instead of one ring buffer, you have dedicated buffers feeding each organ:
•  sensory_artery → SensoryCore
•  emotional_artery → Sandbox
•  haptic_artery → EMITTER-LOCK
